{"id":"wb-5-450","name":"东钱湖石刻","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"东钱湖墓葬群","text":"东钱湖墓葬群是中华人民共和国浙江省宁波市鄞州区东钱湖沿岸一批古代墓葬的统称，包含众多宋、元、明三代名臣学士墓道。其中的史氏墓道是中国现存唯一的南宋墓道石刻群。2001年以东钱湖石刻的名义被列入第五批全国重点文物保护单位，2013年扩充并更名为东钱湖墓葬群。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E4%B8%9C%E9%92%B1%E6%B9%96%E5%A2%93%E8%91%AC%E7%BE%A4","revisionId":89181326,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=89181326","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/713b714fce26919bf5b9cb7b.jpg","title":"史渐墓道,_2015-02-07_12.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:%E5%8F%B2%E6%B8%90%E5%A2%93%E9%81%93,_2015-02-07_12.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/a/af/%E5%8F%B2%E6%B8%90%E5%A2%93%E9%81%93%2C_2015-02-07_12.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Siyuwj","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"​史渐墓道，位于南宋石刻公园","width":320,"height":213}}